<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Education Management.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Education Management.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Piper Jaffray said it initiated coverage of Education Management Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a $33 price target.</p>
<p>-- said believes Education Management is a &quot;must-own&quot; edcuation stock for the next few years.</p>
<p>-- expects company to grow earnings about 20 percent &quot;in the foreseeable future.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Education Management gained 3/4 to 28.</p>
</text>
